@startuml Feature_UseCase

actor User
participant "Serial-Digital\nBridge Board" as Bridge
participant "Digital Target\nObject" as Target

== Digital Write Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nWrite digital pin HIGH
Bridge -> Target: Set digital output HIGH
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nWrite successful

== Digital Read Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nRead digital pin state
Bridge -> Target: Read digital input
Target --> Bridge: Return pin state (HIGH/LOW)
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nPin state = HIGH

== PWM Control Use Case ==
User -> Bridge: Send serial request:\nPWM config (freq: 1kHz, duty: 50%)
Bridge -> Target: Generate PWM signal\n(1kHz, 50% duty)
Bridge --> User: Serial response:\nPWM configured

@enduml
